  // The shelf's cards stand in front of a face and are lit as they always
  // were: the room for reflections, a key from the upper left, the way
  // every v2 product is lit, a soft cool rim from behind on the right, and
  // a soft fill so nothing goes black. The hero's products float on the
  // dark page itself, where that rim was too weak to find their edges and
  // a dark product went into the dark: the hero turns the rim up, adds its
  // twin on the left, and reflects a room with a bright strip behind each
  // side. Both rooms are maps of the same size and both lightings have the
  // same lights, the shelf's left rim only turned off, so a switch changes
  // what the shaders are given and never which shaders they are.
